SY_TALK("4-X9XajlcFI",[[0,["1984-0708 Public Program 1 at Ilford Town Hall. Ilford (England), To Know The Truth"]],[0,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[7,["In the previous two lectures I told you how to understand the experience of truth."]],[20,["In the first one, we came to the conclusion that if we have to feel the truth,"]],[29,["it’s not our only mental acceptance that it is truth, or our mental projection that it is truth,"]],[39,["but you have to feel it on your central nervous system."]],[49,["In the second lecture I told you that when you feel the truth through your central nervous system"]],[63,["in your evolutionary process, then you become something."]],[74,["You become, you become is the point. Is not that you think you are like this or like that,"]],[82,["but you really become something. Like a flower becomes a fruit or an egg becomes a chick."]],[98,["You have to become something in your awareness, and this new awareness is the awareness of collective consciousness."]],[108,["Where you can feel yourself, what’s the problem with you and you can feel others, on your fingertips."]],[118,["This is a very good English idiom they use, on your fingertips."]],[122,["I mean somebody must have thought of Sahaja Yoga when they formed this I am sure."]],[128,["To use this, you should know it on your fingertips."]],[132,["Now what does that mean? We have never thought of it, we always say so, we should know them on our fingertips,"]],[137,["but actually you feel them on your fingertips."]],[141,["The different centres within you and the centres in other people."]],[149,["As hot or cold, may be as heavy, burning; this you just feel it. You can feel it, others can feel it,"]],[160,["children can feel it and everybody feels the same, because truth is absolute and is for everyone."]],[169,["Whether you have a different caste, community, race, religion, nationality,"]],[177,["all kinds of superficial things, which divides human beings, everyone feels the same."]],[184,["For example, supposing you put a finger to this, (Candle flame) you are going to feel hot."]],[190,["Because you have a different hair style, you are not going to feel something different,"]],[196,["it’s like that. Truth has to be that way, and that is what is the experience of truth."]],[204,["And once you know you have to know the truth and nothing else but the truth."]],[209,["When you decide in your mind and be honest about it then when you see it, it is very obvious."]],[219,["It has to be obvious, it cannot be secretive. It cannot be, it has to be obvious, apparent,"]],[227,["absolutely known to your central nervous system."]],[232,["So you know the absolute as I told you. Like a computer you start working, you ask any questions,"]],[240,["absolute questions and the answers come to you, as cool vibrations for yes and as hot vibrations for no"]],[249,["and sometimes the vibrations stops to say that absolutely no."]],[257,["But it can be some blister sometimes a little bit, to say that it’s satanic."]],[263,["And you can decode it yourself and see for yourself."]],[266,["This is the second phase where you start knowing about others and knowing about yourself."]],[279,["So you become connected with the Absolute. Absolute, means there is no question about it,"]],[288,["absolute means there is no doubt about it, absolute means it is single."]],[300,["Today I have to tell you about what actually happens when this force called Kundalini within you"]],[310,["rises and gives you self-realization. Actually within your self what should happen?"]],[321,["Nobody tells you these things, I mean, they’ll say you are to be reborn, so you have a sort of a certificate,"]],[330,["twice born, reborn and you go about, when it’s not like that."]],[339,["Supposing a monkey puts a sign-board on, “I am a human being”, does he become?"]],[349,["If we just say we are this, we are that, you are not."]],[353,["For example we say we are Muslims, we are Christians, we are Hindus, we are not."]],[360,["Because you have formed a group, you call yourself something, or something that you are not."]],[367,["It’s just your own idea. How are you a Hindu? How are you a Christian?"]],[374,["What all these religions have said that you have to be born again."]],[382,["Every religion, Jews have in a way said it too,"]],[389,["but the problem is that we don’t do what is told to us, we just form a group."]],[401,["Group can be made out of anything nonsensical like, I met some other people the other day"]],[406,["and they told Me our group is called as Knives and Fork."]],[411,["I said “What’s that group?” Knives and Forks, yes very good group,"]],[415,["so I said, “What is that?” “Because we put our knives and forks in a different way than others.”"]],[423,["I said ” But what’s the use?” “No, we form a very strong group.” “For what?”"]],[430,["“We can form a political party tomorrow.”"]],[433,["I said, “All right, go ahead with this kind of a nonsense”,"]],[437,["But it is nonsense, all this is nonsense. What is sensible is that"]],[445,["we have to become something more than what we are. We are human beings,"]],[450,["we have to become more knowledgeable, we have to become the knowledge."]],[454,["That knowledge you cannot get in the libraries or from the books."]],[460,["How do you grow into that knowledge is through this Kundalini awakening,"]],[465,["through this happening that, this Kundalini rises within you"]],[470,["and pierces through your fontanel bone area giving you the real baptism and not the artificial one."]],[478,["The reality again. Supposing somebody doesn’t get it, all right, so he comes back on Me,"]],[486,["“Oh I never got it Mother”. Something wrong, he should get it, should get it."]],[494,["Because we cannot give you a false certificate, you cannot give yourself a false certificate."]],[503,["But it is very common as you see in this world, that when you listen to people who are religious,"]],[512,["you find they are horribly fanatic, funny, stupid people."]],[520,["I mean if you want to hear about each one of them you should go to the opposite party."]],[527,["Like if you want to hear about Hindus go to Muslims."]],[532,["If you want to hear about the Muslims go to Jews and"]],[538,["if you want to hear about Jews go to say Muslims or anyone, Christians, and they’ll tell you."]],[545,["So there’s nothing universal opinion about things."]],[549,["It is surprising for a person who wants to see the truth in every religion,"]],[556,["he cannot understand why people belonging to religion, when God is only one,"]],[562,["why there’s a fight going on. Why this world is divided by, even religious leaders are dividing the world."]],[572,["It is very amazing. So where is this religion? And what happens to our religion?"]],[583,["When we get our self-realization, we become the Self, the Spirit and the Spirit is untarnishable."]],[595,["It’s untarnishable. You cannot cleanse the soap, can you?"]],[604,["But the quality of Spirit is that it cleanses you. First is it cleanses you."]],[608,["Just like a Mother lovingly cleanses the child who has fallen somewhere in the road"]],[616,["and cleanses the clothes and makes the child absolutely neat, tidy, clean"]],[623,["and with great admiration looks at the child;"]],[626,["in the same way the Spirit bathes you with it’s beautiful blessings so that you cleanse."]],[636,["And the second thing it does is to give you light."]],[642,["Now the light doesn’t mean electrical light, it doesn’t mean the light you see inside."]],[649,["What does this light means is your awareness itself."]],[654,["Your awareness itself becomes a higher awareness by which you start seeing things clear cut."]],[665,["Like I know somebody who came to see Me before Sahaja Yoga"]],[673,["and he met Me after say a month, he was a changed man, I could not recognize him."]],[680,["So I said what has happened to him? He came to Me I asked him,"]],[686,["”How are you?” He said “Mother I am fine.”"]],[690,["He used to look very old and haggard and absolutely frustrated. I said “What has happened?”"]],[699,["He said “Mother you know, when I got realisation, suddenly I felt tremendous compassion for everyone"]],[708,["and I had an enemy that was my uncle and I hated him from the bottom of my heart,"]],[716,["and I used to think he has killed my mother, and I could not believe that he has not killed my mother,"]],[723,["so many people told me but still with the hatred I could not get over it."]],[726,["I had insulted him, he had insulted me and if somebody had given me freedom with"]],[731,["a dagger I would have gone and killed him. I hated him from the bottom of my heart."]],[737,["And all the time I thought of killing him, doing this and all the nasty things I could think of."]],[742,["My whole mind was pre-occupied.” “So what happened?” He said,"]],[750,["“Next day I started seeing his good points, I said no he is a very generous man."]],[757,["I have been nastier that he has been, suddenly I started feeling it, that feeling of love,"]],[764,["compassion and when I said uncle, I forgive you completely,"]],[770,["the blissfulness crawled upon me, that’s the first time I’ve felt the joy of my spirit."]],[776,["I had said this before also but I had never felt it,"]],[780,["but first time when I said this I felt it and that bliss was so great and that joy was so great"]],[787,["I said now I must have it at any cost."]],[790,["So next day I saw him at a race, he was a great race goer also, a very rich man."]],[797,["I saw him and I just embraced him. I couldn’t help it. He was surprised, he looked at me,"]],[806,["he said come and have tea with me, and we are great friends now.”"]],[810,["So all that wrinkle, all that horrible anger and all that has gone away"]],[817,["and this divine, serene face was showing its beauty there."]],[823,["But he said “I have done this before, I’ve tried to forgive him, I told myself,"]],[829,["I told many a times that he’s not killed my mother, I should not hate him."]],[834,["I tried to convince myself, but still I could not forgive, I didn’t have the power to forgive."]],[841,["But when I got my self-realization, suddenly the power came to me,"]],[846,["in such a gush. I have become powerful Mother.”"]],[850,["In the Sanskrit language it’s called the word Samarth,"]],[855,["Samarth means powerful but actually means Sama-Artha, it means equal to your meaning."]],[863,["Equal to your meaning, means you become your Self. Samartha."]],[869,["When you become yourself, you become powerful to fight your weaknesses"]],[874,["and you automatically do it without any trouble, spontaneously. Very easy it is to forgive."]],[889,["Not only this, so many things there are which you just do without any difficulty."]],[897,["It is very difficult before realization for a person to think that to part with your little bit of two P’s that you have,"]],[908,["even that is sometimes difficult. You think ten times, calculate it, all right,"]],[913,["if I give two P’s now how much will I get, three P’s or five P’s, all right"]],[920,["if I get three P’s no good, five P’s is all right; but after realization you just give."]],[930,["You just give, you like to give, you love to give, you want to enjoy the giving capacity of yourself."]],[937,["So far the acquiring, acquisition and also the capacity to preserve,"]],[942,["keep everything to yourself becomes a giving capacity."]],[945,["And as a result of that, what you find, you are filled in."]],[954,["Every sort of thing, every sort of material or physical or anything that is needed to make you happy"]],[968,["just comes down. From where, how, God alone knows because it’s only God does the job,"]],[974,["it’s God’s work. So the power to stand up against evil, against injustice,"]],[987,["against wrong doing just changes your priorities completely"]],[996,["and you become a powerful personality. Like Christ when He saw the prostitute,"]],[1005,["Mary Magdalene, being stoned, He saw the disciple Mary Magdalene in her."]],[1013,["He stood up and He said, “Those who have not sinned can throw stones at Me.”"]],[1019,["That character, that strength that stood up there,"]],[1025,["and nobody could even think of throwing stones at Him."]],[1032,["This powerful personality which is compassion, which is righteous, which is virtuous,"]],[1040,["starts shining through you. It’s not a quarrelsome dominating power in which we believe."]],[1051,["According to us a powerful man is the one who can dominate the whole world."]],[1059,["The power of love we have never exploited, never."]],[1064,["All our enterprises, all our worldly affairs, political, economic, are based on hatred."]],[1072,["The power of love in it’s purest from is the most powerful thing"]],[1079,["and that is going to emancipate the whole universe. There’s no other way out."]],[1085,["It doesn’t mean your carnal love or your nonsensical ideas of love, it’s not, it’s pure love."]],[1092,["The pure love is that kind where the sap rises in a tree"]],[1097,["and gives nourishment to all the parts of the tree and goes back. It’s not attached."]],[1106,["If it gets attached to one flower, the tree will die, the flower will die."]],[1112,["So this is the power which empowers you, nourishes you, soothes you,"]],[1120,["consoles you, relaxes you and leaves you powerful."]],[1131,["That sort of a power is to be felt if it is the experience of truth."]],[1137,["But we have never tried to understand love in its own truth."]],[1146,["The reason is we were not realized people. When we are blind, we are mixed up."]],[1154,["We can’t make out one from another but when our eyes are opened out"]],[1160,["we understand the true love. And this is what people have exploited, many of them,"]],[1168,["many so called gurus and these people who talk of God have exploited"]],[1173,["this side of love by teaching dirty things to people, debasing them, using their weaknesses."]],[1181,["Saying that if you do this kind of a weakness, then you will reach God."]],[1189,["Love that makes you a slave cannot be love and that is what it is, the love that is divine,"]],[1203,["is the love of God that starts flowing through you, you become the medium, as you call it,"]],[1211,["of that love. A powerful medium. But you know how to manoeuvre it."]],[1218,["You know everything. It’s not blindly, I have seen some people, oh we are in love, you see going on like that, no."]],[1227,["You know everyone. You know ins and outs of everyone and of yourself also."]],[1237,["I have seen many people coming to Me and saying, “Mother please save me from this Agnya.”"]],[1243,["Now in our language it is this Agnya, but actually it means ego."]],[1249,["You can see your ego clearly once you get realization and we say oh God what is this?"]],[1255,["That’s not me, I am not ego, oh that’s not me, I am the Self, I am the Spirit."]],[1262,["So this separation takes place within yourself, with your own understanding that,"]],[1270,["you are not this body, this mind, this ego, this superego but you are the spirit."]],[1281,["And the more you grow into it, a beautiful personality of a character, which is not a character,"]],[1291,["sometimes people think if you are very meek, is he compromising,"]],[1295,["such a character will never compromise, is a terrific character."]],[1300,["It would never compromise with anything that is not the truth. It cannot by temperament."]],[1308,["But is very kind and compassionate, forgiving."]],[1313,["Gives lots of chances because there’s that inner urge to save others, to save others,"]],[1322,["to help others, to get them to the right thing."]],[1325,["It’s like people who are standing on the brink of a disaster,"]],[1330,["or people who are on the bank and see the people getting drowned and trying to pull them out"]],[1336,["with all their effort. But they don’t want to compromise as to jump or to leave the banks that they have got."]],[1345,["Such a character you develop then and this character is felt by everyone."]],[1353,["I have known many Sahaja Yogis first who came to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1359,["their own family people were angry. Now you are following another Guru,"]],[1366,["this is another cult, this is that. But then they found out that they are giving no money, nothing,"]],[1375,["and they are flowering. In every way they are beautiful, they are becoming better and better people."]],[1384,["Righteous and virtuous people, powerful people of great character"]],[1391,["and they are amazed you know. How do they become?"]],[1396,["And they become very intelligent, they don’t do any stupid things, they just don’t do it."]],[1404,["Even a little child knows it’s stupid. They don’t do stupid things."]],[1410,["They don’t do nonsensical things. They are dignified and they don’t take to cheap entertainments."]],[1420,["The depth that you feel in the poets, in the great musicians, becomes their own nature."]],[1430,["When they talk, when they walk, any rapport with them, you can feel the depth of their spirit."]],[1443,["They become very knowledgeable suddenly. As I told you last time these journalists asked Me"]],[1449,["“Mother have you got all scholars?” I said “Scholars, what.”"]],[1453,["“All scholars are Sahaja Yogis,” I said “No, at the most one percent may be,"]],[1458,["who have been great headaches to me, the rest of them are simple people.”"]],[1465,["Simple people are the best and this is what is true,"]],[1473,["that those who get realization start feeling the knowledge which is absolute."]],[1483,["Seeing the knowledge, knowing the knowledge."]],[1487,["Like if you see, say, this pillar, you just look at it, you say, oh very nicely done painted this,"]],[1496,["somebody might say it should not have been this color, that color."]],[1500,["But a Sahaja Yogi doesn’t see this pillar as to how aesthetically it is and all that,"]],[1507,["but immediately he’ll say it’s beautiful. You’ll say why? It gives vibrations."]],[1516,["The whole aesthetics are worked out through vibrations."]],[1521,["All the beautiful things, as I told you last time, of the world have vibrations."]],[1530,["Real beautiful things have vibrations. Like Mona Lisa I told you the other day,"]],[1535,["if you go and feel her vibrations, she has vibrations."]],[1539,["Now the one who has made her has put his joy into her and she emits vibrations."]],[1551,["And that is the thing that gives joy to you because you are at a level where you can feel those vibrations."]],[1563,["You start feeling the physical side of yours, you understand you have a physical problem."]],[1573,["Immediately you know you have a physical problem, you know where it is,"]],[1576,["how to correct it, how to cure it. I have seen many people who come to me,"]],[1581,["Mother cure my cancer, but they don’t come to Me before they get cancer."]],[1587,["If they had come they would never have got it, but they had no time, at that time they had no time."]],[1594,["But when they get cancer I have no time either. It happens always."]],[1602,["Of course they are to be helped, cured, but why not come as a prevention to all those diseases"]],[1612,["which has no meaning. It is unnecessarily so much accepted that health is first of all."]],[1631,["Then there is nothing to worry about health if you come to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1635,["you don’t need any doctor, sorry for the doctors, I am sorry."]],[1646,["And this is what it is to be understood that physically you feel absolutely fit."]],[1654,["You look fit absolutely. You look marvellous."]],[1661,["Then when you start expanding yourself you start feeling your own mind."]],[1677,["The peace, the bliss of your own mind."]],[1681,["Many a times you’ll find there is no thought but the joy is just bursting in"]],[1688,["and you just think why it has happened. Suddenly, how do I get this?"]],[1696,["Gradually the state of joy starts increasing in its frequency and you become joy."]],[1709,["That is, one has to achieve, to become the joy is important."]],[1718,["And once you become that joy it’s not a duality, it’s not a duality."]],[1725,["It’s not a thing in which you feel the happiness and unhappiness but you feel the joy."]],[1733,["Joy is a witness, it’s a kind of a power of a witness which sees a drama,"]],[1744,["by seeing the drama, whether tragedy or comedy, it’s at a point where it is just a witness and enjoying it."]],[1753,["In the same way you’ll see so called comedies and tragedies of your life"]],[1758,["and the futility of your nonsensical endeavours and you’ll laugh at it, oh that’s it, that’s me."]],[1765,["For example in Romeo and Juliet, Shakespeare has tried to show the futility of all those egos."]],[1773,["According to Indian standards he was Avadhotta, as they call it, a person who was realised"]],[1780,["and was a very evolved personality. And if you want to see how Romeo should get his realization"]],[1787,["and how he should feel that after all that happened he should laugh loudly."]],[1792,["She gets realisation, oh what a fool a stupid thing I was."]],[1799,["Shakespeare did not show him getting realization he kept it for us Sahaja Yogis to see it,"]],[1807,["but should have seen to it that Romeo laughs at himself and makes fun of himself,"]],[1813,["oh stupid Mr. Romeo, now you better settle down."]],[1820,["But he showed and very cleverly if you see in all his Macbeth or any of his dramas"]],[1827,["that he has tried to show the futility of our ego, our enterprises,"]],[1832,["we think that is very important in life."]],[1840,["I would say there are so many great writers in English language,"]],[1843,["which I cannot name them in a series, but I have read them."]],[1847,["Somerset Maugham, I would say was another one. I was very much impressed by his writings"]],[1853,["and read most of his novels because he was very much there."]],[1859,["Cronin for example is another one I would say who wrote Citadel was another great person who"]],[1867,["could see the drama of stupidity. Leave alone your great poets like William Blake and all those."]],[1877,["But all that was to show that there is a higher being you see, which sees all this,"]],[1887,["and giving you a drama of yourself, projecting it through you."]],[1892,["That this is what you are, you see, see yourself."]],[1897,["That’s what they did and despite everything we’re lost. We are lost quite a lot."]],[1909,["We have to become the same like Shakespeare to see the drama,"]],[1916,["like Somerset Maugham, we have to become the same."]],[1921,["To see the drama, we may not write a book, doesn’t matter,"]],[1924,["but the capacity to see the drama, that’s what we develop."]],[1931,["We need not write, we may not have the flare of a pen to write but we see it the same way as they see it"]],[1938,["and that’s the mental capacity to which we rise with self-realization."]],[1945,["I have seen very stupid people absolutely calling themselves gurus,"]],[1950,["you look at them and you don’t know what to say, you see."]],[1953,["You have to look at stupider persons to stupider, that person, what you say, stupidest person,"]],[1961,["in the presence of such a person, because he looks at you, you see,"]],[1966,["and you understand he is stupid and you don’t know what to do."]],[1970,["And you get frightened of such a person you know and you don’t want to hurt his feelings you see,"]],[1977,["so you look the greater stupid person and then he gives you a big lecture,"]],[1983,["on something very stupid. But then you find that person you see,"]],[1990,["big newspapers you see like Times, publishing such a stupid man there."]],[1997,["Just imagine, this is what we have done to Shakespeare, to all our great writers and everyone,"]],[2004,["we have reached that state that we cannot even see the stupidity."]],[2016,["Our brain is stunned because we have been asking for sensations,"]],[2024,["with all these electrical sensations in the brain we are stunned."]],[2030,["Which opens out, which completely opens out and you start seeing, through and through,"]],[2042,["the mockery of all this kind of seriousness and the hypocrisy"]],[2051,["and the way people who are stupid try to give you stupid ideas."]],[2060,["And once you are realised you laugh at yourself,"]],[2063,["oh God I was so stupid, that’s what should happen."]],[2070,["If that does not happen your self-realization has no meaning, it has no meaning."]],[2080,["The righteousness and the virtues become part and parcel of your being."]],[2087,["It’s not that you have to be told anything, you just shouldn’t do it."]],[2091,["It’s beyond your self respect because you respect your Self, you respect your Spirit."]],[2099,["How can you do such a thing? You cannot despise yourself can you?"]],[2107,["You just become virtuous. You may be kind to others even if they are not virtuous,"]],[2113,["you can be nice to them, you can forgive them but as far as you are concerned there is no compromise."]],[2119,["And you enjoy your virtues, you enjoy your magnanimity, you enjoy your generosity."]],[2127,["People will tell you, stupid fool, you go on distributing things what are you doing?"]],[2131,["And you laugh at them. As Lao Tse said, somebody told Me this saying about Lao Tse,"]],[2141,["another great incarnation of the primordial master,"]],[2147,["that when a wise sees the way, he respects it and says this is the way."]],[2155,["That’s the sign of a wise man and a mediocre who is half way this way and that way"]],[2164,["when he sees the way he waits for others to go into it,"]],[2171,["and when the stupid sees the way he laughs."]],[2178,["But when the wise sees the stupid in himself he laughs."]],[2187,["So that power of wisdom starts shinning through you, you become a wise, righteous, virtuous man."]],[2202,["And such a balance you develop. I have known people who are honest, you see, so called,"]],[2209,["now they go to such an extreme of honesty, that for honesty’s sake they’ll kill their father,"]],[2215,["kill their mother, kill everyone."]],[2219,["But such a balanced and integrated person you become"]],[2224,["that whatever you do is good for your spirit and for the spirit of others."]],[2233,["In Sanskrit the word is Haitha [BEST GUESS],"]],[2236,["what ever is good for your spirit and for the spirit of others you do it."]],[2243,["And that is the right thing to do, and that’s how you become a righteous personality."]],[2252,["That’s the religion within you that gets awakened. Nobody has to tell you your religion,"]],[2260,["you yourself become your own master, your own Guru, and by which you determine yourself,"]],[2267,["now Mr. you can’t do this. No you can’t. So you become your own police commissioner."]],[2279,["You don’t need any outsider to tell you."]],[2283,["You are on your own guard because if you do something like that your vibrations will disappear"]],[2289,["and then you don’t like it, don’t like it. Then you feel uneasy."]],[2296,["Nobody has to have you as a Guru, there’s no need you become your own Guru, is the best way."]],[2305,["And that’s how you solve the problem of becoming better by others,"]],[2318,["is very difficult but yourself becoming better, by your own understanding and urges,"]],[2330,["it’s a thousand fold happier and strong."]],[2340,["So the third thing that happens to you, that you become religious, you become the Guru, yourself."]],[2353,["Nobody has to tell you because there is a natural valency of ten within you"]],[2359,["which starts balancing you, and you become one and enjoy that balance."]],[2365,["As you enjoy a balance of colors in a beautiful photograph,"]],[2370,["in the same way you enjoy the balance within yourself. You enjoy your personality,"]],[2374,["you enjoy your being and you enjoy to be the Self."]],[2381,["And those who are on the same level, you just enjoy each other."]],[2386,["This is the first time you enjoy other human being, as if you are enjoying a flower."]],[2395,["The fragrance of that personality is spiritual fragrance, is so beautiful and attractive."]],[2406,["Without any lust and greed in it but just enjoying the company is real perfect bliss."]],[2418,["Thank you very much. May God bless you."]],[2422,["Now, again today, I would like you to ask Me some questions."]],[2427,["There is going to be the fourth lecture, that they will announce."]],[2433,["I hope you will make it a point to come and complete the series of lectures we have been having."]],[2454,["Q1. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[2470,["A1. It’s true. It has been told that you must have a Guru."]],[2474,["But it’s said that it has to be a Satguru. Anybody you see, mostly,"]],[2483,["the gurus who are in the market today. You cannot be in the market,"]],[2489,["and those who are in the market are actually, are nowhere near God."]],[2498,["They have to be Satguru, means he has to be a realized soul of a very high degree."]],[2508,["Now you better become your own Guru. And then you will know that you are a Satguru."]],[2515,["I am the Mother, I am not a Guru. And what is Mother’s desire is? You had a mother also."]],[2522,["Whatever I have, you better have it. That’s all."]],[2528,["So as you have come to Mother, now you don’t ask for any guru, you better become yourself a Guru. All right?"]],[2537,["Q2. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[2547,["A2. No. You see, you must know that the Kundalini awakening itself, breaking through and all that,"]],[2555,["is a big happening. A key event of evolution, the epitome of it, as you know,"]],[2561,["as an Indian you know how Sakshatkar is such a big thing. But to achieve that,"]],[2569,["there must be a big machinery within us. Like you see the electrical bulb here, or a light here,"]],[2574,["you know there is a history behind it, and it is a big mechanism and organization that has worked it out."]],[2583,["In the same way to achieve this there’s a big organization."]],[2588,["So, when you become realized, that will happen very soon to you."]],[2598,["Means you’ll feel the cool breeze coming out of the Brahmarandra, through your fontanel bone area."]],[2603,["But then to develop it, you have to understand, deeper, the mechanism."]],[2609,["Then the mantras are placed according to the deities of these seven chakras."]],[2619,["Now if the Kundalini is stopping, or is weak at a point, any one of these chakras,"]],[2629,["then you have to say a particular mantra for that. Which will be told to you,"]],[2634,["which you can learn very easily. And you will know also about all the mantras that are to be said."]],[2640,["Like, you see, many gurus I have seen give away one mantra. Like they say Ram."]],[2646,["How can that be? You see, there are seven chakras, and if you take Ram,"]],[2654,["he’s on the right side of the heart chakra, means [UNKNOWN SANSKRIT WORD]."]],[2658,["Now, if you are taking the name of Rama, why, why Rama’s name?"]],[2662,["Ask a question to him, you must ask a question. Why Rama’s name, why not Krishna’s?"]],[2669,["Why not Jesus? The reason is, if he’s a Satguru he’ll tell you,"]],[2675,["that you have a problem with your right heart. But all of them here, those who are realization souls,"]],[2683,["can tell you where is the problem. And you will also tell tomorrow."]],[2688,["Q3. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[2690,["A3. No, it’s not. There are seven mantras actually. Basically you must know about seven mantras."]],[2696,["But gradually, you pick it up in no time, because immediately you know where the problem is,"]],[2701,["and immediately you say the mantra. It’s not very difficult, it’s very simple."]],[2704,["It is woven in a pattern and it’s very simple to say those mantras."]],[2708,["But it works out so spontaneously, I mean, these are all people who are English"]],[2714,["and Greeks and this and that, and they don’t know. Even, we can say mantras in English language now."]],[2721,["That’s an advancement I think. That all the deities can understand English language as well."]],[2732,["So you can say it in Sanskrit or in English, it’s all right, it works out."]],[2738,["And, once you know it, it’s so easy to say it, easy to understand. It’s not a problem at all."]],[2744,["But first of all you should get your realization, that’s first thing."]],[2748,["That is you should break through, you see, the seed must break. [INAUDIBLE], its primule must break."]],[2754,["Then the second thing is to see that it sustains itself above the ground."]],[2759,["Then it is to be maintained and developed until you become a tree."]],[2765,["But it’s very simple, it’s not difficult."]],[2769,["Q4. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[2772,["A4. When you get your realization you start feeling the cool breeze coming out of your fontanel bone area"]],[2778,["and you start feeling the cool breeze in your hands. Then you can ask a question,"]],[2783,["is this the breeze of the Adi Shakti? Is this the Chaitanya Lahari of the Adi Shakti?"]],[2788,["Is this the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost? The Holy Ghost is Adi Shakti actually."]],[2793,["Nobody has explained to them, they don’t know. I mean, they asked the Archbishop of Canterbury"]],[2799,["about Holy Ghost, he said “I’m agnostic,” can you imagine?"]],[2803,["Yes, he answered. I mean, if he’s agnostic this Robin Day asked him"]],[2808,["“So what are you doing here?” So he said “I’m doing my job.” So Robin Day said"]],[2813,["“Yes” because he also does the job. He understood it. [HINDI]."]],[2820,["Now the problem is that when you start feeling the cool breeze in your hands,"]],[2825,["you might find that after some time it goes away then comes. See, depends on."]],[2829,["Some people have a express train, as we call it."]],[2834,["But some of them have some bogeys, which go up and down. It doesn’t matter."]],[2840,["We should not frustrate on that point, it works out. One should not get unhappy about it."]],[2848,["Q5. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[2862,["A5. Subconscious. Of course, I mean the same. I am the Self, I am the Spirit, yes."]],[2872,["Like, I’ll tell you, in the bible, Christ clearly said it, very clearly, we don’t read bible that way,"]],[2880,["that’s why. That Nicodemus, you see, He told Nicodemus that you are to be born again."]],[2886,["So, Nicodemus said that does that mean that I should enter into the womb of my mother."]],[2892,["He said no, that is flesh, and the flesh is born out of, whatever is born out of flesh is flesh."]],[2900,["You are to be born of your Spirit. And whatever is born of the Spirit is the Spirit He said."]],[2908,["But how many people follow that? That’s the consciousness I’m talking of, the real Selfhood."]],[2920,["What we do, in the churches, or in our Indian, any one of the religions that we have."]],[2929,["We put the water on the head, now you are baptized, you are a Christian."]],[2933,["For a Hindu they put a string, now you are a Brahmin, without knowing a word about Brahma."]],[2938,["[INAUDIBLE]. So now, there is reality."]],[2945,["All these people didn’t tell us lies you see, never told us lies."]],[2951,["But the truth is always covered by the intellectuals, by the intelligent people on one side"]],[2958,["and by the fanatics on the other side, and that’s why the problem comes in."]],[2963,["Q6. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[2975,["A6. You see, because, what happens that intellectuals rationalize it."]],[2980,["They say whatever we see, we see the science, so we don’t want to believe."]],[2984,["Now recently there has been a controversy about Christ miracles, isn’t it."]],[2988,["There, lets take this thing very recently, there’s a controversy about Christ’s being born of a virgin."]],[2999,["He was born of a virgin, no doubt, but how can you convince an intellectual you see,"]],[3005,["because He cannot be born of a virgin. But He was born."]],[3010,["All these miracles are absolute truth, no doubt."]],[3013,["So the problem is they want to see through science. Now science is analytical,"]],[3017,["it is not does the synthesis. Science deals with the dead."]],[3024,["It deadens everything, it analyzes, and whatever you see you think it’s the truth, no,"]],[3028,["but it’s just a part of the truth. Now why do they accept?"]],[3034,["See now, big challenge, is intellectual. This was Mr Paul, who came in."]],[3041,["When I was a child I asked My father, who is this Paul?"]],[3046,["My father, being a very great realized soul himself, he said, he was another mad man."]],[3053,["And this Paul had never seen Christ. What we call, he had a supraconscious,"]],[3059,["a kind of a [CONDITION or POSITION?], he got blind and all that."]],[3062,["And then he became, he was a horrible man, he killed so many Jews,"]],[3067,["he killed the young boys for [STEALING?] you know he did all sorts of things and then suddenly,"]],[3071,["he becomes a big Christian. Because he saw some sort of a political thing in that."]],[3077,["So what does he say, he doesn’t talk of Christ as He was, he talks of a Christ"]],[3082,["which was the church Christ, the Christ of the church."]],[3087,["Now, Christ of the church has nothing to do with real Christ, has nothing to do."]],[3093,["So now, because they have to accept, the churches have to accept Paul,"]],[3098,["they cannot accept Christ. It’s a good idea. Either accept Christ, or accept,"]],[3104,["this is what happens with intellectuals. Even in India it has happened."]],[3108,["I’ll tell you when, when Adi Shankaracharya, he wrote a book called Viviketurya."]],[3115,["It’s a great treatise. About Athvaida [BEST GUESS] he said that God is everything,"]],[3121,["Brahma is everything. A beautiful treatise he wrote. So there was a fellow called Vishra,"]],[3129,["Mandan Vishra [BEST GUESS], is a great learned man, another intellectual,"]],[3134,["he came to argue with him. And he argued and argued and argued,"]],[3138,["you see with argument where do you reach? You cannot by arguing give realization to somebody."]],[3141,["And he said, “Why don’t you take your realization?” But he argued,"]],[3147,["he said “You defeat me.” He said “I don’t want to defeat you I want to give you realization,"]],[3151,["why don’t you take your realization?” He would not take the realization."]],[3156,["So, the intellectual, you see, tortured his life. He was so fed up, Adi Shankaracharya."]],[3164,["The book he wrote was Saundarya Lahiri, if you ever happen to read it,"]],[3168,["it’s nothing but the praise of the Mother, throughout. He said this is how [SANSKRIT]"]],[3174,["not by yoga by Sankara [BEST GUESS] by discussion, it’s only through Mother’s grace"]],[3177,["you are going to get realization [INAUDIBLE]."]],[3183,["So the intellectuals, you see, want to derive a pleasure of an intellectual feat out of most if it."]],[3190,["It’s not the real that they are seeking. They read, a lot, achieve nothing."]],[3199,["I have known people who are very learned, who have written many books"]],[3202,["and they are so horribly immoral within their private life you can’t believe it that they could be philosophers."]],[3211,["And you don’t understand, how can you be, why are you so hypocritical? But they are."]],[3217,["Because they are not realized souls. And an ordinary person, you find a realized soul."]],[3223,["Just uneducated. That’s why Kabira has said Pari Pari Pundita Mura Kabai,"]],[3231,["by reading too much you learned have become stupid. But I don’t say all learned are stupid."]],[3241,["No. But learning should reach that supreme power of intelligence, which is pure intelligence."]],[3249,["Then obviously you see the thing and you accept if you are honest as I said in the beginning."]],[3254,["You must have that pure intelligence to see, God is there."]],[3259,["He’s above everything, he’s above your intelligence, above your thoughts."]],[3264,["You have to feel him first, you have to rise. That is the transformation, if you cannot achieve,"]],[3270,["then how can I talk to you? If a person is blind,"]],[3278,["what’s the use of talking about colors to a blind person, what does he understand?"]],[3285,["He can’t even see whether I’m smiling or laughing or if I’m crying. What can you talk?"]],[3291,["So the eyes must be open, and these eyes which I’m talking of are above your thought."]],[3299,["You cannot by your projection get it."]],[3303,["It has to come to you. It’s a grace. Ashedvard [BEST GUESS]."]],[3312,["Q7. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[3320,["A7. No You see what I would suggest that what happens that once you get your realisation"]],[3326,["then I have seen a person who has developed the intellect,"]],[3332,["understands it in an intellectual way what realization is"]],[3338,["and a person who is not supposed to be so intelligent starts talking like saints."]],[3346,["I had gone to a village in India and there was a person who was, I was going on a bullock cart,"]],[3352,["he was driving Me and I asked him when he did you get your realization"]],[3356,["and then he started talking to Me. I said “Kabira is driving Me or what?”"]],[3361,["How is he talking like this?” The truth, tremendous, what intelligence."]],[3369,["How much Christ studied in what university?"]],[3376,["So we should not misunderstand intelligence I mean the divine intelligence,"]],[3384,["that’s a very different thing."]],[3387,["Q8. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[3403,["A8. You are, all the time, if you, Shaktipad [BEST GUESS] is the word they use it,"]],[3410,["Shaktipad you see, but it is very much misused. Shaktipad means people start dancing like mad,"]],[3416,["they start shouting screaming how can that be Shaktipad? That’s madness, that’s possession,"]],[3421,["you get possessed. Shaktipad means if somebody is a Shakti,"]],[3429,["you see the Shakti of that person enters into your being and invites your Kundalini"]],[3434,["so the Kundalini rises. That’s what actually it is"]],[3437,["and then the Kundalini rises and makes you a beautiful person"]],[3442,["it doesn’t make you a mad person no how can it be?"]],[3446,["Just imagine now after evolving yourself from amoeba and all the donkeys"]],[3451,["and all the monkeys and what else, oh, cockroaches are you going to become a mad person?"]],[3460,["Or a frog, jumping like that."]],[3465,["So this is very much, that’s why I don’t use very much Shaktipad power because these days"]],[3470,["every Dick, Tom and Harry is using you see. Shaktipad that’s not what I mean."]],[3477,["Shaktipad means if somebody has Shakti it just works."]],[3480,["You don’t go and put it in the head of that person, it just flows, all right?"]],[3486,["But it was used in Patanjali’s day in that way but who reads Patanjali? Nobody reads I think"]],[3493,["nobody reads and talks about it. What they talk is some sort of a head standing"]],[3498,["some sort of a [SOUNDS LIKE SHEERSH] asana that’s all. I mean that’s we, we, we, part of it."]],[3503,["Nobody reads him I mean if you read it, I mean, [INAUDIBLE] you see what he has written is"]],[3509,["that’s what I am doing. I am quite surprised how people talk about this thing."]],[3515,["What he says you achieve [SANSKRIT] means you become effortless"]],[3522,["first [SANSKRIT] you become without thoughtless,"]],[3527,["then the third thing he says you become complete negation of thought, [SANSKRIT]."]],[3535,["But here it is they are all jumping, talking big, this, that, how can that be?"]],[3540,["Meditation means jumping in the air, how can it be? [HINDI]"]],[3546,["Indians understand thank God, Indians are that way you see, safe."]],[3551,["But there should be seeking in India. You see these people are seeking"]],[3555,["and striving and they are the ones who want it, I must tell you very frankly"]],[3560,["they are the people who really are nicely seeking, in England I am saying not in India."]],[3566,["But Indians are not seeking that, but they have one great thing in them is that they know what is reality."]],[3577,["They understand. You see like some of the people who went to a Guru,"]],[3582,["I must tell you, and he gave them a mantra for which he charged £300 in secret, in the ears,"]],[3589,["nobody to be told. And the mantra was “Tinga”. “Tinga” and they told Me in the ear"]],[3600,["and I couldn’t help laughing, “Tinga” means showing like this to someone."]],[3608,["And he used to giggle at people because they were all so stupid, poor things,"]],[3612,["but they were seekers, real seekers, you know,"]],[3615,["of such high quality and this fellow who told Me was a barrister can you imagine?"]],[3624,["Q9. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[3640,["A9. Yes, you are part, you are part of the whole. You are part and parcel of the whole."]],[3645,["The microcosm becomes one with the macrocosm,"]],[3649,["as we say in Sanskrit is Virata, you become part and parcel of that Virata."]],[3655,["Q10. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[3672,["A10. No, no, no. [INAUDIBLE] Correct."]],[3677,["See it may look like that because the myth of responsibility drops out."]],[3686,["Supposing, this wire thinks that it is responsible for what I am speaking,"]],[3693,["does it become more efficient? Say, what responsibility we have is like this."]],[3701,["When we are going by a plane, question is very good, I have seen it. I mean actually,"]],[3707,["it must be understood in its full context it’s correct that when you think it is the responsibility of God"]],[3713,["you see, then you become irresponsible."]],[3716,["On the contrary, you become an instrument into his hands you see."]],[3721,["But you don’t think that you are doing it yourself, like you are sitting in the play."]],[3727,["I give this example many a times because I have seen this happen."]],[3730,["Some villagers never knew how to go by plane so they were told not to take too much luggage."]],[3735,["They sat in the plane and put all their luggage on their heads."]],[3739,["Carrying the responsibility of the plane, saying that we have to carry the load"]],[3744,["because we don’t want the plane to carry all our loads you see."]],[3749,["So that myth drops out, that myth drops out."]],[3754,["But you become a very efficient person"]],[3757,["because the energy that’s divine starts dynamically working, manifesting."]],[3763,["You become a dynamic person, you can do a thousand and one things"]],[3767,["which you have never done before, because you have become a perfect instrument."]],[3771,["You are not perfect as long as you think you are doing it, you see My point?"]],[3781,["All of them, those who are realised souls, and you will be too."]],[3795,["What work are they doing, is spiritually they are doing a lot of work, now,"]],[3799,["that’s another side when you’ll come to Sahaja Yoga we’ll tell you what work they are doing."]],[3805,["You see what work you want us to do may not be the work that we are doing"]],[3810,["but we are transforming people. We are saving people from cancers and so many diseases,"]],[3815,["we are transforming them, we are changing them so much that they have given up drugs."]],[3820,["So many people have given up alcohol, all these bad habits have dropped out."]],[3826,["So many people are cured of so many diseases, so many diseases we have cured already,"]],[3831,["when you come to us we will let you know as to what substantial work it is. all right?"]],[3837,["Starvation of course, our starvation. Why people are starving also"]],[3843,["because I think people who drink are starving because they waste their money in drink."]],[3850,["If they haven’t, if they have money why should they drink?"]],[3853,["If they don’t have money why should they drink? But most of the people starve themselves"]],[3857,["because they spend all their money, in UK I am saying, not in India, India is a different thing."]],[3862,["But in India people who have got realization are blessed they don’t starve anymore."]],[3869,["[INAUDIBLE]"]],[3882,["They don’t need anything, it is said that Yoga Kshema Wiam Miam,"]],[3886,["first you get your yoga, your union with God and then I will bless you. Kshema."]],[3893,["[INAUDIBLE]"]],[3897,["Yes, yes, of course, of course you can pay your rates, everything,"]],[3901,["but you just come and see before. This is the intellectual side, come inside and see,"]],[3906,["whether it works out or not. Why not see? Don’t argue for arguments sake, it works out."]],[3912,["There’s somebody sitting behind you who has, in his life it has worked out, just behind."]],[3919,["In many lives it has worked out but you come and see for yourself what miracles it has, all right?"]],[3925,["You come and see all previous things just drop off."]],[3929,["Come and see how God is blissful after all the blessings come from God."]],[3934,["But we don’t want to do anything for God and why not God look after us,"]],[3939,["what have you done for God so far. Can I ask a question?"]],[3948,["Everyone has right to ask a question to Me, I better ask you all. What have you done for God?"]],[3958,["Just surrender it. [INAUDIBLE] You are afraid? [INAUDIBLE] Afraid of God? [INAUDIBLE] Pray?"]],[3975,["But what we pray to God is “Give me my food. Give me a job."]],[3982,["God get me this. Let me win this war. Let’s kill my enemies” I know all those prayers."]],[4013,["Q11. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4020,["A11. First you get connected all right. First let us get connected then you will know."]],[4027,["Then you will know what He wants and what He does."]],[4032,["Then you will know He is very kind man, very kind,"]],[4038,["extremely forgiving that the way He has forgiven us for whatever we have done."]],[4044,["But don’t feel guilty for it, that’s one thing I didn’t want to start,"]],[4047,["because you see that’s one trouble you all have is to feel guilty and I don’t want you to feel guilty"]],[4051,["because realization doesn’t work out."]],[4054,["Don’t feel guilty it’s all right. We’ll have it next time madam, is it something important?"]],[4065,["Q12. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4092,["A12. Talk. Talking is not the thing,"]],[4095,["you see what I would say you should see the way they talk has nothing to do,"]],[4101,["what you have to see, what have you achieved yourself."]],[4105,["Whatever people may talk is they might be talking because they are possessed, that’s all."]],[4110,["If somebody talks big be careful, be careful, the one who does, isn’t."]],[4119,["You have to feel the cool breeze coming out of your head is the point I said that nobody can do,"]],[4124,["can anybody do that?"]],[4127,["Those who talk can be good actors at the most, at the worst they are possessed. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4139,["Q13. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4150,["A13. Your married life improves immensely."]],[4154,["Because you will learn later on there is a centre for it and you understand your married life as a bliss,"]],[4161,["it’s absolutely pure blessings to married people. Actually you will be surprised"]],[4167,["we can’t give realization to people who are not married, in the sense"]],[4170,["who are going to marry is all right. But those who are against marriage we can’t give realization"]],[4178,["because they are a little imbalanced."]],[4181,["I think the one we had you see, we couldn’t give realization, I hope he’s not here."]],[4190,["But he is going to get married so we will give him realization,"]],[4195,["we just couldn’t give him, but married life improves like this."]],[4200,["Q14. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4220,["A 14. What is it about Bhagwan? [HINDI]"]],[4233,["This kind of a Bhagwan, who cannot even smell a flower. Can you think of a Bhagwan like that?"]],[4243,["You know in the Devi Mahatmayam or into the Vishnu Shastranama,"]],[4248,["or anyone of them where there is a described God at least twenty five names of God is he’s fond of flower, fragrance, flower."]],[4256,["I can’t live without flowers and the fellow who cannot smell a flower [HINDI]"]],[4262,["I mean what do you give him? Phenyl or something?"]],[4268,["This is one of the tests. How can you be a Bhagwan? [SANSKRIT] These are the names of God."]],[4288,["Q15. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4309,["A15. You see, say now if I give you Indian money say 100 rupees how do you know it is 100 rupees?"]],[4314,["You have to go to India and spend it and see if it works out or not."]],[4318,["In the same way when you get the vibrations and you feel the cool breeze you spend it"]],[4323,["and see for yourself and judge it."]],[4329,["You can do the whole process yourself, you can give realization to others all right?"]],[4339,["You see now I would say please get your realization, if you get it, I don’t promise, if you get it."]],[4344,["That’s a very big if, sometimes. I know it happens if you get it"]],[4351,["then you have to go and see for yourself whether it works or not."]],[4357,["But to get it is not easy in certain cases,"]],[4363,["so be cheerful about it and be patient with yourself."]],[4370,["More patience is needed with yourself, not with Me because I am extremely patient."]],[4374,["You have to be patient with yourself because your mind will be coming up and always saying something,"]],[4379,["you didn’t ask this question, you should have asked this question, tell your mind to be quiet."]],[4383,["Take your realization, lets see if it works out."]],[4387,["We cannot assure, it may, it may not, it’s your luck, that’s it."]],[4395,["Q16. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4423,["A16. This conscious mind that you have just now is the human awareness, all right,"]],[4428,["at this point the human awareness is at such a stage, that you are not connected with your spirit."]],[4435,["First your human awareness has to be raised it has to be brought to that point"]],[4439,["where you get connected. Like this instrument is here now,"]],[4443,["consciously whatever you do with this it is not connected, it has no meaning."]],[4447,["In the same way first you should be connected."]],[4450,["After connecting only we can see where is the problem is, what is missing, what is it"]],[4454,["and is to be done. So we have to take a very reasonable attitude towards it,"]],[4459,["about ourselves, to understand that maybe there is something missing,"]],[4463,["something is happening, it’s not working out."]],[4468,["Because at this awareness, at this consciousness that you have, this human consciousness is not sufficient."]],[4475,["So you have to jump, there’s a breakthrough, and you have to achieve that breakthrough."]],[4479,["Which I will not promise, as I told that gentleman there you, it cannot be promised,"]],[4483,["it has to be achieved. If you get it then you have to have patience with yourself work it out and see for yourself."]],[4491,["Q17. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4503,["A17. Yes They did because that was the time you see."]],[4506,["Now Jesus came at a time when our Agnya chakra was opened,"]],[4509,["see it’s like a Tree of Life has to grow you see and They come at a proper time what has to grow."]],[4518,["Now if it’s the root time and somebody else came in, when the shoot started"]],[4522,["somebody else came in gradually it has come up to this point. Now Mohammed,"]],[4526,["what Mohamed has said, nobody says that today."]],[4529,["All the Muslims must know that He said “At the time of the resurrection your hands must speak”,"]],[4534,["where is that? He said it I mean nobody else but Mohammed had said so clearly about it."]],[4540,["And what does He say is not known nobody knows why He said [INAUDIBLE-namas] like this."]],[4547,["Nobody asked questions, why do you follow?"]],[4550,["But after Sahaja yoga will know what [INAUDIBLE] what Mohammed means,"]],[4554,["who He was and why He said so what is so important about it."]],[4559,["You can’t understand even Mohammed or anyone, Jesus or anyone, without realization"]],[4564,["because you have not entered into that rank, you see My point."]],[4570,["Because the time that time was not to say whatever They had to do They did very important work very, very important."]],[4576,["Every one of Them have worked very hard."]],[4580,["Only I must say that today I am at an advantage than They are"]],[4588,["because so many are getting self-realization. They had a very bad time."]],[4597,["They had a very bad time nobody accepted Them. All acceptance came later on when"]],[4604,["They were not there and people liked to have such acceptance"]],[4607,["because they can do what they like. They don’t want to,"]],[4612,["nobody asked Them for realization at that time, nobody, everybody tried just to kill Them."]],[4616,["I mean everybody was anxious how to get rid of Them, isn’t it a fact?"]],[4625,["Like today as there are so many who want their realization that time was not there."]],[4629,["Today is the time, all right?"]],[4634,["Q18. [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4665,["A18. You see that you don’t even need one minute for that, to say, “I’m born again”"]],[4669,["it is all self-opinionated thing, just to say. But you have to have powers you see"]],[4675,["that’s what I told you the whole lecture was like that."]],[4677,["That once you get self realised you get the powers you have collective consciousness you become conscious."]],[4682,["You see it is very easy to say, just to put the, I don’t know how much they pay"]],[4688,["but you just put the name membership “I’m born again”. You don’t know this born again people,"]],[4693,["horribly hot tempered, useless people absolutely. You see some of them brought some bibles"]],[4698,["and one lady bearing all artificial jewellery here and there and she came to give Me the bible"]],[4702,["and I just ignored her. I just started laughing and she was quite surprised to hear this sound."]],[4708,["So this is what born again how can they be born again if they can’t make out a saint."]],[4714,["How can they be born again? [INAUDIBLE]"]],[4731,["Only the truth will survive. All these are fads and things [INAUDIBLE] it has no meaning."]],[4742,["Let’s have our realization now all of us, but I don’t promise as I said it’s your own lookout."]],[4750,["If you believe in our, according to Indian thing if you believe, according to our former karmas"]],[4756,["according to our previous things that we get Atma Sakshatkar, because it’s the highest to have."]],[4763,["So let’s see what happens. And also My compassion, My love,"]],[4769,["My desire that you all should get your realisation and establish it"]],[4775,["and become powerful Sahaja yogis and understand it fully."]],[4782,["Now those who are here have to follow what I say,"]],[4789,["is very simple method by which you help yourself. As I said you are your own guru"]],[4793,["and on different chakras we have to work it out and it works."]],[4799,["So please take out your shoes for one reason, that the Mother Earth helps us"]],[4804,["to sort of earth some of the problems that have come from the Mother Earth."]],[4811,["Now, you have to keep your eyes shut throughout, not to open your eyes."]],[4819,["The reasons are many but one of them is that the centre of Agnya,"]],[4827,["which is placed between the pituitary and the pineal body, is a very important centre."]],[4835,["It is the gate and it doesn’t open if your eyes are open outside just now."]],[4843,["So please keep your eyes shut till then and maybe the kundalini may not also rise."]],[4849,["The whole attitude should be that I should get my realization. You’re not going to lose anything,"]],[4855,["I don’t take any money, nothing of the kind, and there is nothing to gain out of it anyway."]],[4861,["So just you have to gain something out of it so, in a humble way,"]],[4866,["you have to sit down and put your hands on your lap."]],[4872,["Those people who have come for the first time, or are standing there, can come forward here"]],[4878,["and sit down and the Sahaja yogis should give them places."]],[4881,["Sahaja yogis should never take the first places, I would request, it would be a good idea."]],[4906,["All right, just try to sit on the side if possible, those who have come for the first time."]],[4916,["[ASIDE ABOUT A PARKED CAR]"]],[4998,["Now, as I told you, you don’t have to do anything. It’s an effortless thing that happens,"]],[5004,["it’s a happening, and the kundalini rises by itself."]],[5009,["Only put both your feet straight on the Mother Earth. Straight, as far as possible,"]],[5014,["straight touching the Mother Earth. But those who are sitting on the ground are all right,"]],[5018,["they can sit with [HINDI], on the ground is all right. [HINDI]"]],[5034,["Now put your both the hands towards Me, as I told you, and close your eyes."]],[5048,["We have to have a proper attitude towards ourselves."]],[5053,["Firstly, it’s going to be the happiest thing that is going to happen to us,"]],[5057,["and the highest thing that we have been asking for ages."]],[5062,["So we are not to be in any way under any tension about it, it’s really happening to all of us."]],[5068,["Sit with a very cheerful mind, not frivolous but cheerful mind."]],[5074,["And secondly you have to respect yourself."]],[5078,["If there is any guilt or anything in your mind, it won’t work out, as I told you."]],[5082,["You must know you’re saints, born to get self-realization."]],[5086,["You are, as described by William Blake, you are men of God, who have to become prophets,"]],[5094,["who will have powers to make others prophets."]],[5097,["So, that is the attitude we should have towards ourselves, that’s how you are here today."]],[5102,["Please do not condemn yourself, do not have any guilt about yourself, nothing of the kind."]],[5108,["Just believe in yourself, that you are the Spirit."]],[5113,["Now, you have to keep both the hands on your lap (you can keep your purse down, lady, you can keep it, it’s all right)."]],[5124,["Now put your both the hands towards Me, close your eyes fully."]],[5130,["Some of you must have already started feeling a little cool breeze in your hands."]],[5136,["Put both the hands like this, open upwards, just as like you do for [INAUDIBLE] or something."]],[5151,["The left side, as I told you the other day, is for your desire, and the right side is for action."]],[5159,["So we are going to put the left hand, all the time, as it is, desiring to be one with the Divine."]],[5166,["And the right hand we are going to use for the action of removing the obstacles in our centres."]],[5180,["So, first put the right hand on the heart, just on the heart, on the left hand side."]],[5188,["Here resides the Spirit in human beings, so, now you ask Me a question without opening your eyes."]],[5200,["You can call Me Mataji or Mother, as you like, whichever way you want to call Me."]],[5207,["“Mother, am I the Spirit?”"]],[5213,["Ask the question thrice, you have a right to ask Me that question."]],[5237,["Now this right hand has to be taken down on the stomach, on the left hand side, on the upper part of the stomach."]],[5244,["This is the centre of your mastery, or what we call the guru centre, it is on the left hand side of your stomach."]],[5255,["On the left hand side you put this right hand. Put the left hand towards Me as it is."]],[5262,["Now, here you ask a question, because you, as a spirit, has to be your own master, has to be your own Guru."]],[5272,["So you ask Me a question thrice again, “Mother, am I my own Guru?” ask Me."]],[5279,["With full confidence, “Am I my own master?”"]],[5283,["On the higher part of the stomach, please put your right hand on the higher part of the stomach."]],[5305,["Now, put this right hand on the left hand side of your stomach, in the lower region."]],[5316,["There’s a centre there, in the lower region of your stomach, lower region of your stomach."]],[5321,["On the left hand side, keeping the left hand towards Me."]],[5325,["Now, this is the centre where is the knowledge of the working of your kundalini."]],[5343,["In this centre, called as Shuddha Vidya, meaning the pure knowledge."]],[5350,["As this point, I’m sorry but you have to ask for it, I cannot force anyone into it,"]],[5359,["like you cannot force a student to accept any knowledge."]],[5364,["In the same way you have to say “Mother, give me that pure knowledge” or you can say “Mother, please give me that Shuddha Vidya”,"]],[5377,["you have to ask six times, because this centre has got six sub plexuses."]],[5382,["So you have to ask six times, in a very humble way, “Mother, please give me that Shuddha Vidya”."]],[5393,["That is the first asking."]],[5399,["See this prayer, this is such a pure prayer. Give me the Shuddha Vidya, give me the pure knowledge of the Divine, the working of the Divine."]],[5414,["Now, as you have entered into that realm of asking Me for the pure knowledge, the first thing you have to assume, is that"]]]);
